                                                "sense_id": "bda043e3-5c60-3f38-96a1-bfc76a08f4f9",
                                                "text": "Miss Quinn thought that Oswald spoke Russian well in view of his lack of formal training; she found the evening uninteresting. Donovan, with whom she had a date later, testified that she told him that Oswald was “kind of an oddball.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc552219-f0f6-408f-a8f1-c4c54dc872dd",
                                                "sense_id": "bda043e3-5c60-3f38-96a1-bfc76a08f4f9",
                                                "text": "\"She's different, mister. A real oddball, if you know what I mean. But your little girl would love her. All kids love the Doll Lady.\""
                                            }
